## Demo Scenarios (Pre-Calculate for Demo)

- **Wonder Valley, Grande Prairie, AB** — Large hyperscale, evaporative cooling; expect red water score, Indigenous flag, high grid strain.
- **Lévis, QC** — Smaller enterprise, liquid immersion, renewable PPA; expect green carbon, better sociological score.

