## Repository Structure (from Spec)

- `frontend/` — Next.js app; `src/app/page.tsx` (landing + proposal form), `src/app/results/page.tsx` (results dashboard), `src/components/` (ProposalForm, ImpactDashboard, ScoreCard, MapView, ReportViewer), `src/types/assessment.ts` (TypeScript types matching backend models).
- `backend/` — FastAPI (main.py, models.py), calculator/, data_sources/, ml/, llm/.
- `data/` — Pre-downloaded CSVs, census SQLite, reserves centroids (gitignored except samples).
- `models/` — grid_strain_model.pkl.
- `scripts/` — train_grid_model.py, download_data.py, load_census_to_sqlite.py.

