## Judging & Design

- **Judging:** Innovation & originality, technical complexity & execution, product experience & design, impact & practical value.
- **UI contrast:** Show company “Promises” (e.g. soft green) vs “Calculated Reality” (bold charts). Map-first where relevant; minimal, professional for council/planners.
